      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5258203794772085854\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29AA1.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e⚡️\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e You can now create agentic bots in \u003cb\u003ejust 2 taps\u003c/b\u003e \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5372981976804366741\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA496.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🤖\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eAsk the devs of the services you use to support it \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5305522282695768654\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9187.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e👇\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://core.telegram.org/bots/features#managed-bots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003ehttps://core.telegram.org/bots/features#managed-bots\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e",
