      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5199749070830197566\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8E81.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🎁\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Our new\u003cb\u003e Login Widget\u003c/b\u003e is a \u003cb\u003egift\u003c/b\u003e to developers: they can not only quickly \u003cb\u003eauthorize\u003c/b\u003e users, but also request users’ \u003cb\u003ephone numbers\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cb\u003epermission to message\u003c/b\u003e them on Telegram. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5841267724285646096\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8693.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🆓\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e \u003cb\u003eSign-up, login, phone verification\u003c/b\u003e, and a \u003cb\u003efollow-up communication channel\u003c/b\u003e in one — \u003cb\u003ecompletely free\u003c/b\u003e.",
