      "id": 0,
      "message": "The apartment in Russia where I lived 20 years ago received a summons for “Suspect P. V. Durov”. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eThey must be suspecting me of defending Articles 29 and 23 of the Russian Constitution — which guarantee freedom of speech and the right to private correspondence. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eProud to be guilty! \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5384214488809490070\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F988F.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e😏\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e",
